      "message": "test: cover linked IPv4 lookup and ASN byte order\n\nUse a single-prefix map with a four-byte ASN to cover the last ASN encoding class.\nTruncating the offset in that class must invalidate the map.\nNative IPv4 and its RFC 6052, RFC 6145, 6to4 and Teredo forms must resolve to the same ASN.",
