        "payload": "tree 718641d54bb07cfa4701d5613e715ae1e255a002\nparent 3feadee5692aeaf74e1b8a0c0303fc3e5b7c7399\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1795619322 +0100\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1795777430 +0100\n\nutil: simplify ASMap integer decoding\n\nSkip classes with a set continuation bit, then shift in the bits of the offset within the selected class.\nKeep returning `INVALID` for an empty class list before reading the selected class size.\n\nOn a Raspberry Pi 5 (GCC 13.3, Release), ASMapCheckStandard went from 42.65 to 39.29 ms (8.6% faster) and ASMapGetMappedASMulti went from 2266 to 2081 ns/address (8.9% faster).\n",
