        "payload": "tree 5f3c4bfb8c512ba1b340480c99ba67a71678ee3d\nparent 24be3840133153cc0593288046e0a8620c1444d8\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1795619333 +0100\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1795777433 +0100\n\nnet: reserve space for the address group\n\nReserve room for the group tag and up to `ADDR_INTERNAL_SIZE` address bytes. This also covers the four-byte ASN of a mapped group.\n\nOn a Raspberry Pi 5 (GCC 13.3, Release), ASMapGetGroupMapped went from 1744.1 to 1639.8 ns/group (6.4% faster) and ASMapGetGroupNoMap went from 394.11 to 307.28 ns/group (28.3% faster). Both grouping benchmarks use one IPv4 address.\n",
